  "current_objective": "Prompt: Realm9 Website Content Redesign\n\nRedesign and implement the website content only in realm9-nextjs. Do NOT modify colate/realm9 or redesign the UI yet. Our priority is to finalize meaningful, professional marketing content across all pages before working on the visual design.\n\nUse colate/realm9 as the source of truth for Realm9's actual capabilities, features, modules, statistics, and product positioning. Review the existing application and identify newly introduced capabilities that are missing from the current marketing website.\n\nContent requirements:\n\nModules section: Rewrite and enhance the module names, descriptions, and supporting content shown in the screenshot. Clearly communicate what each module does and the value it provides to customers.\nExisting pages: Review and improve the hero headings, descriptions, section content, and CTAs. Preserve the meaning of Realm9's existing content while making it more compelling, concise, and premium.\nNew capabilities: Incorporate relevant features introduced in colate/realm9 that are not yet represented on the marketing website.\nNew pages: Develop meaningful, audience-specific marketing content for pages such as Startups and other routes that were not part of the original Realm9 website. Ensure every page accurately communicates how Realm9 serves its intended audience.\nStatistics: Use only verified statistics and product claims from colate/realm9. Do not invent metrics, capabilities, or customer claims.\n\nContent direction: Take inspiration from the existing Realm9 website, but do not simply copy its wording. Rewrite the content to reflect Realm9's current capabilities and give the website a fresh, premium, enterprise-grade identity that meets professional SaaS marketing standards.\n\nEvery page should help a potential customer immediately understand what Realm9 offers, what problems it solves, how its capabilities benefit them, and why they should explore the platform further.\n\nFirst, audit the existing website content against colate/realm9, identify missing or outdated information, and then implement the improved content across all relevant pages in realm9-nextjs.\n\nImportant: Focus exclusively on content, messaging, and page structure. Preserve the existing UI, styling, routes, and functionality. We will work on the visual redesign separately after the content is finalized",
